    "Column \"amount\" is the detail column and \"total\" the net column; column headings are not printed.",
    "Printed period is Calendar Year 2025, Quarter 4, the same as 2025-q4-cash-flows. The catalog title of this PDF is \"Quarterly Statement of Cash Flows (4th Quarter)\", but the form itself is the same FDP Form 9 and no other fund or period is indicated.",
    "Compared with 2025-q4-cash-flows, every figure is identical except: Other Receipts 309,566,674.29 (vs 194,885,190.39, +114,681,483.90), Total Cash Inflow 4,707,937,227.73, Net Cash from Operating Activities 1,253,984,001.25, Net Increase in Cash 803,626,884.40, Cash at Beginning 3,797,565,473.82 (equal to the other file's Cash at the End of the Period) and Cash at End 4,601,192,358.22. The two pages are therefore different versions of the same Q4 2025 report rather than different funds; which is authoritative is not stated. This copy is marked SIGNED by hand.",
    "Figures appear to be year-to-date (January-December 2025): the Share from Internal Revenue Collections (1,811,818,888.00) equals the full-year NTA."
